# COMPONENT

## Crud

### PACKAGE

org.sample.crud

### DESCRIPTION

CRUD sample component for item management backed by SQLite.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates the same model-driven CRUD surface as `04-crud`,
but the backing store is SQLite instead of the default in-memory store.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

Two domain viewpoints are modeled:
1. Item lifecycle (`Item` service): create, read, and list item records.
2. SQLite-backed persistence: the generated CRUD surface persists through the CNCF SQLite datastore path.

### LIFECYCLE

Typical item flow:
1. `createItem`
2. `getItem`
3. `listItems`

### DOC_USAGE

Descriptions under `COMPONENT`, `SERVICE`, and `OPERATION` are intended to be reused for generated program comments and user-facing artifacts.

# SERVICE

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Item-facing operations for basic CRUD access.

### OPERATION

#### createItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates a new item record.

##### IN

Item creation payload.

##### OUT

Result of item creation.

#### getItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Returns a single item by identifier.

##### IN

Identifier of the item to retrieve.

##### OUT

Item lookup result.

#### listItems

##### DESCRIPTION

Lists item records with optional filters.

##### IN

Filter and pagination fields for item listing.

##### OUT

List/search result projection.

# ENTITY

## SimpleEntity

### DESCRIPTION

Shared identity base for domain entities.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

## Item

### features

extends = ["SimpleEntity"]

### DESCRIPTION

Core item record used by the CRUD sample.

